ous pale silver full moon hangs low above clouds, dominating upper frame composition. No sun, no dual celestial light sources, no bright daytime sky. Gentle cool moonlight washes over stone pillars, pine branches, mist and the mecha girl’s armor, building ethereal, tranquil, dreamy and futuristic atmosphere.\n\nEvery frame of <Subject 1> must strictly match every detail from reference image <Picture 1>, zero random alteration to appearance or mecha outfit.\n\n[Shot 1] Pure first‑person handheld POV shot. No photographer, no camera equipment or second human figure appears within frame, only the viewpoint of an off‑camera photographer. At the beginning, camera follows behind the mecha girl <Subject 1> as she carries out slow patrol above translucent misty clouds. Clouds under her feet flicker in and out of view, softly swirling around her ankle mechanical components. The blue energy lights on neck, chest and shoulders pulse softly. Camera slowly orbits from rear to side‑front. Before she arrives at frame middle area, facial details remain slightly soft. As she drifts smoothly toward exact middle of frame, camera’s focus plane locks onto her face, upper body and key armor structures. Once she is in frame middle position, facial features, eyes and mecha details achieve full sharpness, background renders soft bokeh. She turns head slightly toward camera with calm, gentle and confident smile, then strolls leisurely above cloud layer while talking to off‑screen photographer. Camera holds stable medium close‑up framing after focus locks. Relaxed elegant posture, behaving like walking upon soft mist. Forbid fast movement, forbid flying across frame, forbid shrinking into tiny distant figure, forbid complicated fine‑motor finger movements.\n\nOff‑screen photographer (S2, not visible): <d>[Chinese] 哈啰你好啊！我觉得你好酷，方便给你拍一张吗？</d>\n<Subject 1> (S1): <d>[Chinese] 我正要去云间执行巡逻任务。</d>\nOff‑screen photographer (S2, not visible): <d>[Chinese] 没事没事，超快！我就拍两张就行。</d>\n<Subject 1> (S1): <d>[Chinese] 哦，那你快一点哦。</d>\nOff‑screen photographer (S2, not visible): <d>[Chinese] OK，你往这边站一下。像你这样的机甲战士，应该很多人想拍吧？</d>\n<Subject 1> (S1): <d>[Chinese] 没有。</d>\nOff‑screen photographer (S2, not visible): <d>[Chinese] 那你在这里多久了？</d>\n<Subject 1> (S1): <d>[Chinese] 我核心系统已经运行5000多年，外表永远保持18岁。</d>\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:10.000, handheld camera speed slows noticeably. The mecha girl <Subject 1> stands beside carved stone pillar, stays within frame middle area and remains in sharp focus. She keeps soft lively calm smile and relaxed natural posture, all character and mecha details consistent with <Picture 1>. Mist continues flowing gently underneath her feet, mechanical luminous components keep soft pulsing, sustaining light futuristic ethereal presence. Camera executes subtle slow push‑in toward her face, maintain sharp definition for facial features, eyes and armor details.\n\noverall_soundscape: Real heavenly‑palace ambient noise, soft wind soughing through pine boughs, low rumbling flowing cloud ambient tone, faint distant ethereal wind‑chime sounds, subtle low mechanical hum from mecha armor.\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [298.6354064941406, 219.00579833984375], "pos": [-981.1187744140625, 425.135986328125], "id": 54, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 14}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.48.6", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1115.0453140757402, 932.5274507413274], "scale": 0.37190082644628436}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "H3 loaders + Turbo LoRA", "bounding": [-334.4547424316406, -190.5315399169922, 1049.6949462890625,